---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Shellui | The Opinionated Microfrontend Shell
description: Shellui is an open-source microfrontend shell for web apps. Shared auth, admin, storage, and navigation so you can build the product, not the infrastructure.
---
    {# Hero — Evidence shell: split copy + chrome frame. No blob gradients. #}
    <div class="relative px-6 pt-8 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl py-10 sm:py-12 lg:py-14">
        <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12 xl:gap-16">
          <div>
            {% set latestPost = collections.blog[0] %}
            {% if latestPost %}
              <div class="mb-5 inline-flex">
                <div class="relative flex items-center gap-x-3 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-sm/6 text-gray-600 ring-1 ring-gray-900/10 hover:ring-gray-900/20 dark:text-gray-400 dark:ring-white/10 dark:hover:ring-white/20">
                  {{ latestPost.data.heading or latestPost.data.title }}
                  <span class="h-4 w-px bg-gray-900/10 dark:bg-white/20" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <a href="{{ latestPost.url }}" class="font-semibold text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">
                    <span class="absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>Read more
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl dark:text-white">
              Build the App.<br class="hidden sm:inline" /> Not the Infrastructure.
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base font-medium text-pretty text-gray-500 sm:text-lg/8 dark:text-gray-400">
              An <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">open-source</span>, <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">opinionated microfrontend shell</span>. Shared chrome — navigation, auth, storage, admin — so <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">solos and small teams</span> ship apps instead of rebuilding the shell.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3">
              {% set playgroundIconSize = "size-5" %}
              <a
                href="{{ site.playground }}"
                class="playground-cta inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-primary px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-xs hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >
                {% include "playground-app-icon.njk" %}
                Open playground
              </a>
              <a
                href="{{ site.docs }}"
                class="rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:border-gray-700 dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-gray-900"
              >
                Read the docs
              </a>
              <a
                href="{{ site.github }}"
                class="text-sm/6 font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >
                GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          {# Bordered shell frame: sidebar chrome + config as interior proof. Gold only on the active nav item. #}
          <figure class="min-w-0">
            <figcaption class="sr-only">Shell chrome with a shellui.config.ts excerpt showing navigation, authentication, and storage.</figcaption>
            <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-950">
                <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-700" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-700" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-700" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-[0.65rem] text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">shellui</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex min-h-[18rem] sm:min-h-[20rem]">
                <aside class="flex w-[6.5rem] shrink-0 flex-col gap-1 border-r border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-2 sm:w-36 sm:p-3 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-950" aria-hidden="true">
                  <div class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 py-1">
                    <svg class="size-3.5 text-gray-900 dark:text-white" viewBox="0 0 1080 1080" aria-hidden="true">
                      <use href="#logo-shellui-mark" />
                    </svg>
                    <span class="hidden font-semibold text-[0.65rem] text-gray-900 sm:inline dark:text-white">Shellui</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="rounded-md bg-primary/15 px-2 py-1.5 text-[0.65rem] font-medium text-primary-ink dark:bg-primary/15 dark:text-primary">Billing</span>
                  <span class="rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-[0.65rem] text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">Files</span>
                  <span class="rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-[0.65rem] text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">Admin</span>
                  <span class="rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-[0.65rem] text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">Settings</span>
                </aside>
                <div class="min-w-0 flex-1 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-950">
                  <div class="border-b border-gray-200 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[0.65rem] text-gray-500 dark:border-gray-800 dark:text-gray-500">shellui.config.ts</div>
                  <pre class="overflow-x-auto p-3 font-mono text-[0.65rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-700 sm:p-4 sm:text-xs dark:text-gray-300"><code><span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">import type</span> { ShellUIConfig } <span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">from</span> <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">"@shellui/core"</span>;

<span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">const</span> config: ShellUIConfig = {
  backend: {
    type: <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">"shellui"</span>,
    login: { methods: [<span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">"oauth"</span>] },
  },
  navigation: [
    {
      label: <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">"Billing"</span>,
      url: <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">"https://app.example.com/billing"</span>,
      requiresAuth: <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">true</span>,
    },
  ],
  storage: { enabled: <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">true</span> },
};

<span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">export default</span> config;</code></pre>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# Capabilities as joints in one system — not a row of equal icon cards. #}
    <section id="features" class="relative z-10 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="mb-8 max-w-2xl animate-on-scroll sm:mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl dark:text-white">
            Four joints. One shell.
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Shell, identity, files, and admin are seams in the same runtime — configured together, not four products to stitch yourself.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white divide-y divide-gray-200 animate-on-scroll dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:divide-gray-800 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-4 lg:divide-x lg:divide-y-0">
          <a href="/features/microfrontend/" class="group flex flex-col p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-50 sm:p-7 dark:hover:bg-gray-800/50">
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">navigation · layout</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Shell</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
              Iframe apps, sidebar or top bar, toasts, themes, i18n — from <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem] dark:bg-gray-800">shellui.config.ts</code>.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 group-hover:underline dark:text-white">
              Microfrontend <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span>
            </span>
          </a>
          <a href="/features/authentication/" class="group flex flex-col p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-50 sm:p-7 dark:hover:bg-gray-800/50">
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">backend · login</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Auth</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
              Sign-in lives in the shell. Identity-service or Supabase; public, domain, or invitation-only.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 group-hover:underline dark:text-white">
              Authentication <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span>
            </span>
          </a>
          <a href="/features/storage/" class="group flex flex-col p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-50 sm:p-7 dark:hover:bg-gray-800/50">
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">shellui.storage</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Storage</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
              Company bucket, private by default. Grants, share links, quotas through the SDK.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 group-hover:underline dark:text-white">
              Storage <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span>
            </span>
          </a>
          <a href="/features/administration/" class="group flex flex-col p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-50 sm:p-7 dark:hover:bg-gray-800/50">
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">admin · inject</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Admin</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
              Embedded admin for users, groups, logs, and tokens. Inject your own apps from config.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 group-hover:underline dark:text-white">
              Administration <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 animate-on-scroll">
          <a href="/features/" class="text-sm/6 font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:underline dark:text-white">
            See all features
          </a>
          <span class="mx-3 text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-700">|</span>
          <a href="/roadmap/" class="text-sm/6 font-semibold text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:underline dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-white">
            View our roadmap
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {% include "home-faq.njk" %}

    <div class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-24 dark:bg-gray-950">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:mx-0">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
            See it running.
            <br />
            Then read how it works.
          </h2>
        </div>
        <dl class="mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-16 gap-y-12 text-base/7 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:gap-x-24">
          <div class="playground-cta">
            <dt class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Try Shellui now</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
              Explore a live Shellui app — navigation, auth, and the full shell — with no install and no scaffolding.
            </dd>
            {% set playgroundIconSize = "size-6" %}
            <a
              href="{{ site.playground }}"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-primary px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-xs hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              {% include "playground-app-icon.njk" %}
              Open playground
            </a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Read the docs</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
              Follow the documentation to scaffold a project and start building with the shared shell.
            </dd>
            <a
              href="{{ site.docs }}"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:border-gray-700 dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-gray-900"
            >
              Read the docs
            </a>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
